	pubDate={new Date('August 02 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		Hey, I'm Kayan. I am a Technical Educator and Observability Solutions Engineer.  
		I'm a lifelong learner who enjoys making complicated ideas easy to understand.
	</p>
	<p>
		This is where I document what I'm learning across software engineering, cloud infrastructure, 
		artifical intelligence, Scripture, career, motherhood, immigration and everyday life.
	</p>
	<p>
		These are working notes rather than declarations of expertise. Some will be reflections, 
		some will be polished tutorials, while others will continue evolving as I learn.
	</p>
	<p>
		For more information on who I am, visit https://kayanhales.org
	</p>
</Layout>
